  "translation": "Na mi bai givim moa long ol de bilong yu, faifpela ten na faiv yia; na long han bilong king bilong Ashur mi bai pulapim yu gutpela, na ⟨את⟩ dispela taun; na mi bai lukautim dispela taun, bilong mi yet, na bilong David, wokman bilong mi.",
